\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Prompt-equalized detection accuracy by model scale. Blue: ADAGE LOO pipeline; orange: hedging regex baseline. Error bars: bootstrap 95\% CIs. Dashed line: chance (50\%). The trend is monotonically non-decreasing across all six models. The Llama~3B error bars nearly reach the chance line, reflecting signal fragility at the smallest scale. The 7B$\to $14B jump (+11.5\,pp) is the largest inter-model increment, suggesting the knowledge-conflict threshold activates in this range.}}{18}{figure.caption.45}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:scale_trend}{{2}{18}{Prompt-equalized detection accuracy by model scale. Blue: ADAGE LOO pipeline; orange: hedging regex baseline. Error bars: bootstrap 95\% CIs. Dashed line: chance (50\%). The trend is monotonically non-decreasing across all six models. The Llama~3B error bars nearly reach the chance line, reflecting signal fragility at the smallest scale. The 7B$\to $14B jump (+11.5\,pp) is the largest inter-model increment, suggesting the knowledge-conflict threshold activates in this range}{figure.caption.45}{}}
